**/.*/*
!.github/*
!.cargo/*

# Cargo build output (includes rootfs, images, and kernel binaries)
**/target

# Build cache: downloaded toolchains, compiled busybox, etc.
# Survives `cargo clean` (which only removes target/).
/.build-cache

# Legacy locations (safe to remove from checkouts that predate #79)
*.img
/ignored
/rootfs
/zCore/disk

.DS_Store
__pycache__

